sitory.md/sections/104","section_title":"Why the SK order parameter has no gaps","claim_refs":["sha256:9a43c3eddb32c8ae6201629ef2e4df2d94167dc286a45dd429a8dff192df88b5/nodes/support.first_variation"],"evidence_class":"source_argument","treatments":[{"claim_id":"support.first_variation","kinds":["statement","explanation"],"rationale":"States the admissible one-sided derivative formula and explains the separate penalty and reoptimised-control contributions. Nonnegativity of the derivative requires a minimiser; the cited formula itself applies to admissible coefficients and feasible directions.","claim_ref":"sha256:9a43c3eddb32c8ae6201629ef2e4df2d94167dc286a45dd429a8dff192df88b5/nodes/support.first_variation"}],"query_href":"/api/v1/papers/query?manifest=41f03ec0a8b1d30d68310120008da72a73f8c3f4cc88d65acbde651f5ad06a20&paper=expository&passage=first-variation&representation=matches","reading_href":"/api/v1/papers/reading?manifest=41f03ec0a8b1d30d68310120008da72a73f8c3f4cc88d65acbde651f5ad06a20&paper=expository&passage=first-variation"},{"ref":"sha256:93145ef5687bb57439b6b2cb17b3f040069f7144f8a92e8bed7d3d18237af961/papers/expository.md/sha256:479155de953858e60f1454491ccda2215d88a4c2780e686cdfb8422481c62d9c/papers/expository.json/passages/zero-candidate","stage":"expository","anchor":"zero-candidate","content_span":{"start_byte":45248,"end_byte":46415,"start_line":1070,"end_line":1108},"section_ref":"sha256:93145ef5687bb57439b6b2cb17b3f040069f7144f8a92e8bed7d3d18237af961/papers/expository.md/sections/44775","section_title":"7. Optional calculations","claim_refs":["sha256:9a43c3eddb32c8ae6201629ef2e4df2d94167dc286a45dd429a8dff192df88b5/nodes/support.diffusion","sha256:9a43c3eddb32c8ae6201629ef2e4df2d94167dc286a45dd429a8dff192df88b5/nodes/support.first_variation","sha256:9a43c3eddb32c8ae6201629ef2e4df2d94167dc286a45dd429a8dff192df88b5/nodes/support.moment_identity","sha256:9a43c3eddb32c8ae6201629ef2e4df2d94167dc286a45dd429a8dff192df88b5/nodes/support.regularity","sha256:9a4